# Throwaway PNGs only. This used to be a blanket `*.png`, which silently
# dropped every product image: the Phase 01 baseline was never committed, and
# each image under public/ is in the repository only because someone forced it
# past the rule. Scope the ignore to the directories that actually generate
# disposable screenshots (DEC-066 / F34).
playwright-report/**/*.png
test-results/**/*.png
coverage/**/*.png

# design-sources/ is deliberately TRACKED (DEC-071). It holds the uncompressed
# masters the deployed AVIF/WebP set was generated from, and they existed in
# exactly one copy each — on one machine — until they were committed. It stays
# out of public/ so it is never deployed, but it is not ignored.

.agents/
skills-lock.json
